    {
      "id": "block-lesson-48-dialogue",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "你今天开始上班了，新工作怎么样？",
          "pinyin": "nǐ jīn tiān kāi shǐ shàng bān le, xīn gōng zuò zěn me yàng?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Alors, tu as commencé à travailler aujourd’hui : ce nouveau travail, ça donne quoi ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-3164476701daee91bc9b0020",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/3164476701daee91bc9b0020.m4a",
            "sha256": "206e5f0ec5ebb6054f2f7684e1a240c6930bc9bd4a9e5fb06103b0c32c0d2f90",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3681
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "很好！人很多，但是大家都欢迎我。",
          "pinyin": "hěn hǎo! rén hěn duō, dàn shì dà jiā dōu huān yíng wǒ.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Très bien ! Il y a beaucoup de monde, mais tout le monde m’a bien accueilli."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-e04d1d27c2acccd4b98aa5c5",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/e04d1d27c2acccd4b98aa5c5.m4a",
            "sha256": "290a3bf456052342a1e632a77bb3ff2f5fa0273b5e17488890eeedf622678ca7",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3934
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "你在哪里工作？",
          "pinyin": "nǐ zài nǎ lǐ gōng zuò?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Tu travailles où ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-f9912924f1363f23ea5ae16a",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/f9912924f1363f23ea5ae16a.m4a",
            "sha256": "81f825f0b7d5b4466e2236cf8de3fbf106904efbdb478701ff0529ca16a04083",
            "durationMilliseconds": 1756
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "火车站前面的小商店。我今天已经看了五次时间。",
          "pinyin": "huǒ chē zhàn qián miàn de xiǎo shāng diàn. wǒ jīn tiān yǐ jīng kàn le wǔ cì shí jiān.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Dans le petit magasin devant la gare. Aujourd’hui, j’ai déjà regardé l’heure cinq fois."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-37eb00871e05ca8414ae07b5",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/37eb00871e05ca8414ae07b5.m4a",
            "sha256": "9ecec6b5bef5f00e9e2df832f5e7ce344cdd45647da8bbcdd0dceb10e46398ab",
            "durationMilliseconds": 5043
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "五次？你想回家了吗？",
          "pinyin": "wǔ cì? nǐ xiǎng huí jiā le ma?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Cinq fois ? Tu as déjà envie de rentrer ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-0b81d3d5b669100938f8df1e",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/0b81d3d5b669100938f8df1e.m4a",
            "sha256": "4995e9cdff5ddec9fdf216d2f9966033238586a77281121c7ef35603de0d6112",
            "durationMilliseconds": 2775
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "不是想家，是商店有新电脑，我在等很多人来看。",
          "pinyin": "bú shì xiǎng jiā, shì shāng diàn yǒu xīn diàn nǎo, wǒ zài děng hěn duō rén lái kàn.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Ce n’est pas ça : le magasin a de nouveaux ordinateurs, et j’attends que beaucoup de gens viennent les voir."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-f9652eefbedc152f5aa0f7cb",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/f9652eefbedc152f5aa0f7cb.m4a",
            "sha256": "d731ce3ea137f77150da58be960c56e548602382c6ee8e1ab87d142ecaff160e",
            "durationMilliseconds": 4380
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "那你现在还在工作吗？",
          "pinyin": "nà nǐ xiàn zài hái zài gōng zuò ma?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Et là, tu travailles encore ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-2d8c1514c3cde4286e35aa82",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/2d8c1514c3cde4286e35aa82.m4a",
            "sha256": "ee9ab002b204da14f068ccc31e54979c8aa7791a3081ddb910f7040938972ebe",
            "durationMilliseconds": 2367
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "在，我还有一点工作。你今天做什么了？",
          "pinyin": "zài, wǒ hái yǒu yì diǎn gōng zuò. nǐ jīn tiān zuò shén me le?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Oui, il me reste un peu de travail. Et toi, qu’as-tu fait aujourd’hui ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-ddc08cbd52d269d2458aefaa",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/ddc08cbd52d269d2458aefaa.m4a",
            "sha256": "b59c48595e1cc06d8840cd60434c1a95732deeef8a7436702cb74aa357fa9785",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3760
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "我今天开始读一本新书，是汉语书。",
          "pinyin": "wǒ jīn tiān kāi shǐ dú yī běn xīn shū, shì hàn yǔ shū.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Aujourd’hui, j’ai commencé un nouveau livre, un livre de chinois."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-8280183d15774a6dfecf1cd3",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/8280183d15774a6dfecf1cd3.m4a",
            "sha256": "10e4638eea248c1d90dad98ea3f7a54dcdfa7b42a65a5ea822c0a28da6c102bd",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3712
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "太好了！明天你告诉我，书怎么样。",
          "pinyin": "tài hǎo le! míng tiān nǐ gào sù wǒ, shū zěn me yàng.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Génial ! Demain, tu me diras ce qu’il vaut."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-b4ac8604085cf6cda0d4060e",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/b4ac8604085cf6cda0d4060e.m4a",
            "sha256": "ceeb5bf5dd3717ff7d38e1292eaa0e3cbf7c4a409fa9a30c45af7bfeb9cba49e",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3681
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "metadata": {
        "stage": "understand",
        "skill": "listening",
        "lessonDay": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block-lesson-48-reading",
      "storyID": "story-lesson-48",
      "level": "HSK classique 2",
      "title": {
        "fr": "Ma première journée"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "lesson-48-p1",
          "hanzi": "我在火车站前面的小商店工作。商店里有新电脑，也有新衣服。",
          "pinyin": "wǒ zài huǒ chē zhàn qián miàn de xiǎo shāng diàn gōng zuò. shāng diàn lǐ yǒu xīn diàn nǎo, yě yǒu xīn yī fu.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Je travaille dans le petit magasin devant la gare. Il y a de nouveaux ordinateurs et de nouveaux vêtements."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-2ffc4fdcdbeee6375956059d",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/2ffc4fdcdbeee6375956059d.m4a",
            "sha256": "c1cf6b5468ff10f1370d8123eb91f966534e1d14bcd60c051709e069de626183",
            "durationMilliseconds": 7374
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "lesson-48-p2",
          "hanzi": "今天来了很多人，我看了很多次时间，还没喝水。现在我开始想家了。我想回家看电视。",
          "pinyin": "jīn tiān lái le hěn duō rén, wǒ kàn le hěn duō cì shí jiān, hái méi hē shuǐ. xiàn zài wǒ kāi shǐ xiǎng jiā le. wǒ xiǎng huí jiā kàn diàn shì.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Aujourd’hui, beaucoup de gens sont venus, j’ai regardé l’heure très souvent et je n’ai pas encore bu d’eau. Maintenant, la maison commence à me manquer. Je voudrais rentrer regarder la télévision."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-cfe9ac8a4ae10881e8840952",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/cfe9ac8a4ae10881e8840952.m4a",
            "sha256": "3b454fe88c7bd5f9c8c6c71029e2956b7dab7e0368d97abb0f76e99217ae51c0",
            "durationMilliseconds": 9619
          }
        }
      ],
      "comprehensionExerciseIDs": [
